LISTEN PODCASTS ONLINE ON YOUR iPHONE

Podcasts app is the best way to listen to the podcasts on any of your iOS device. More than 1 million Podcasts to listen for free with rankings per country. Now you can listen the best podcasts & radio stations of your country or of your homeland when you are abroad.

PODCASTS APP FEATURES:

- More than 1 million Podcasts with rankings per country;
- Listen podcasts with AirPlay connected device;
- Listen any music for free
- Listen to the best radio stations;
- Radios from more than 200 countries and territories;
- Listen to over 50,000 radio stations;
- Recently played songs on the radio;
- Share using Facebook, Twitter, SMS, Email;
- Search radio station by country, by genre, by state or by city;
- Listen in the background;

